  "description": "GitExtensions plugin that displays branches hierarchically in a persistent non-modal\ntree window.  Branches separated by '/' are shown as nested folder nodes under three\nfixed root sections — LOCAL, REMOTES and TAGS.\n\nFeatures:\n  • Real-time filter across all sections\n  • Right-click context menu: Checkout, Nova branch, Mesclar, Rebase, Renomear, Excluir\n  • Double-click / Enter to checkout\n  • Bold highlight for the currently checked-out branch\n  • Working-directory combo populated from GitExtensions history\n  • Auto-refresh on checkout and repository switch\n  • Status bar: Local N | Remoto N | Tags N",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "GitExtensions.ZimerfeldTree",
  "isPrerelease": false,
